jordy: I'll take the Go part. +1 on the context change and sample test.
sanjay: I'll review the overall wording, will add a short callout about retries not re-applying side effects.
alyssa: Cool. I'll tidy the inline links and update the anchor that was 404 (thanks). :thumbsup:
emily: Thanks team — will rebase after your updates and request final review.
